12. When NOT to Use Virtual Threads?
Scenario

Prime Number Calculation

while(true){
   calculatePrime();
}

Better
Executors.newFixedThreadPool(
        availableProcessors);

One-Liner
CPU Work → Fixed Thread Pool

I/O Work → Virtual Threads

13. Structured Concurrency
Scenario

Fund Transfer needs:

Customer Service

Account Service

Fraud Service


Run together.

try(var scope =
  new StructuredTaskScope
  .ShutdownOnFailure()) {

   var c =
      scope.fork(
      this::getCustomer);

   var a =
      scope.fork(
      this::getAccount);

   var f =
      scope.fork(
      this::getFraud);

   scope.join();
}

One-Liner
Manage multiple tasks as one unit.

14. ConcurrentHashMap
Scenario

Multiple threads updating cache.

❌ Bad

HashMap


✅ Good

ConcurrentHashMap<String,String>
      map =
      new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

One-Liner
ConcurrentHashMap is thread-safe.

15. BlockingQueue
Scenario

Producer Consumer

BlockingQueue<String> queue =
      new LinkedBlockingQueue<>();

queue.put("A");

queue.take();

One-Liner
BlockingQueue handles synchronization automatically.

16. ReentrantLock
Scenario

Need timeout while acquiring lock.

lock.tryLock(
