19. Executor Shutdown
Must Remember
executor.shutdown();

One-Liner
Always shutdown ExecutorService.

20. Most Asked Senior Question
Can Virtual Threads Replace WebFlux?
Answer

For many I/O-heavy applications:

YES


Example

try(var executor =
    Executors
    .newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor()) {

    executor.submit(
      () -> jdbcCall());
}

One-Liner
Virtual Threads make traditional blocking code scalable.

